Software bundled into every build
---------------------------------

Every build carries third-party-licenses.txt beside its interface: the full
licence text of each npm package bundled into the interface, and in the
desktop build also of each Go module and the Go standard library linked into
the shell. It is generated from the lockfile on every build by
scripts/write-notices.ts, so it lists exactly what that build contains. All
are permissive licences (MIT, BSD, Unlicense).


Fonts
-----

No font files are distributed. The interface's font stacks name Ranade, Excon
and Satoshi, which are Indian Type Foundry fonts under the ITF Free Font
License and are used only where already installed; everywhere else the
system's own fonts are used.


